{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00255",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.11,
      "end_seconds": 3.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Good evening. Sorry to keep you waiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.63,
      "end_seconds": 7.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Thanks. Sorry, I'm a little early."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 8.22,
      "end_seconds": 12.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Right, thank you for fitting us in, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.25,
      "end_seconds": 17.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Good, that'll be useful. Pull up a chair. Have you been here before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.26,
      "end_seconds": 22.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "A couple of times, you know, but not recently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.88,
      "end_seconds": 25.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Tell me what's been troubling you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.43,
      "end_seconds": 41.21,
      "duration_seconds": 13.78,
      "text": "Yeah, it's trouble hearing in my left ear. I don't know what's causing it. My family kept telling me to get it checked. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.94,
      "end_seconds": 48.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "How long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.49,
      "end_seconds": 58.53,
      "duration_seconds": 9.04,
      "text": "It's been three weeks now. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.69,
      "end_seconds": 62.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Right, does it come along with anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.49,
      "end_seconds": 74.56,
      "duration_seconds": 11.07,
      "text": "Difficulty following conversation in crowds goes along with it, most of the time. Oh, um, and a feeling of fullness in the ear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.86,
      "end_seconds": 76.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "What about headache?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.24,
      "end_seconds": 79.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "No, no headache."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 82.99,
      "end_seconds": 87.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Actually, doctor, I did notice headache. He doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.51,
      "end_seconds": 94.09,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.77,
      "end_seconds": 101.0,
      "duration_seconds": 6.23,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Any ear pain, dizziness or discharge at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.07,
      "end_seconds": 105.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "No, no ear pain, dizziness or discharge."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.24,
      "end_seconds": 111.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.0,
      "text": "Any facial weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.14,
      "end_seconds": 114.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Not at all, no facial weakness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.04,
      "end_seconds": 119.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.03,
      "end_seconds": 124.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Uh, no, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.8,
      "end_seconds": 127.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.72,
      "end_seconds": 129.51,
      "duration_seconds": 0.79,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.45,
      "end_seconds": 146.69,
      "duration_seconds": 7.24,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. What medicines are you taking at the moment? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.66,
      "end_seconds": 151.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "Right, I take pantoprazole, 40 milligrams, before breakfast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 152.12,
      "end_seconds": 160.59,
      "duration_seconds": 8.47,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the pantoprazole was 20 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.3,
      "end_seconds": 167.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "I see. Is the most recent prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.08,
      "end_seconds": 172.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "I don't think I have it with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.14,
      "end_seconds": 175.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "Does anything run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.97,
      "end_seconds": 181.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.0,
      "text": "My grandmother had breast cancer. Okay, so my father had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.82,
      "end_seconds": 186.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.67,
      "end_seconds": 200.71,
      "duration_seconds": 13.04,
      "text": "I have diabetes. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. Yes, high blood pressure. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.06,
      "end_seconds": 201.81,
      "duration_seconds": 0.75,
      "text": "Go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.34,
      "end_seconds": 216.53,
      "duration_seconds": 13.19,
      "text": "Oh, um, yes, acid reflux. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.34,
      "end_seconds": 224.11,
      "duration_seconds": 6.77,
      "text": "Right, so that's your known high blood pressure. We'll keep that in mind today. Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.7,
      "end_seconds": 227.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "No operations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.1,
      "end_seconds": 231.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.7,
      "end_seconds": 246.93,
      "duration_seconds": 14.23,
      "text": "Yes, uh, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.44,
      "end_seconds": 249.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.88,
      "end_seconds": 254.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Pollen. I come out in... well, sneezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.19,
      "end_seconds": 256.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.81,
      "end_seconds": 260.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "I smoke about ten cigarettes a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.97,
      "end_seconds": 262.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 262.8,
      "end_seconds": 264.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "I don't drink at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 265.83,
      "end_seconds": 275.78,
      "duration_seconds": 9.95,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Temp 37.0 degrees, respiratory rate 16, heart rate 84, blood pressure 119 over 77, oxygen saturation is 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.11,
      "end_seconds": 278.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.88,
      "end_seconds": 282.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Okay, let's do a quick examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.59,
      "end_seconds": 284.29,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Hm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.64,
      "end_seconds": 288.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "I'll just listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.96,
      "end_seconds": 310.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.91,
      "text": "There's a lot of wax in the left ear canal, I can't see the drum."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.1,
      "end_seconds": 315.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Right, now I'm going to check this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.66,
      "end_seconds": 332.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "The right ear canal and drum are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 333.11,
      "end_seconds": 334.06,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "Yes, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.86,
      "end_seconds": 359.7,
      "duration_seconds": 20.84,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. From what you've told me and what I found, my working impression is hearing loss from wax. An inner ear problem is also on my list. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had trouble hearing in your left ear for three weeks, and no dizziness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 361.11,
      "end_seconds": 362.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 364.14,
      "end_seconds": 391.97,
      "duration_seconds": 27.83,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a hearing test for hearing loss. I'll start you on ear drops, three times a day, for five days. That should help with wax softening. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up. Please don't use cotton buds or ear candles, they push the wax in further. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 392.7,
      "end_seconds": 406.25,
      "duration_seconds": 13.55,
      "text": "If you smoke, this is a good moment to think about stopping, and we can help you with that. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 406.83,
      "end_seconds": 409.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Okay, uh, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 410.48,
      "end_seconds": 415.95,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 417.04,
      "end_seconds": 419.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Oh, got it, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 420.89,
      "end_seconds": 423.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again after the hearing test."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 425.46,
      "end_seconds": 426.16,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 427.2,
      "end_seconds": 431.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 432.94,
      "end_seconds": 438.45,
      "duration_seconds": 5.51,
      "text": "So, I come back after the hearing test. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 439.76,
      "end_seconds": 444.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Right, we're all set. Don't leave without asking if something's unclear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 444.73,
      "end_seconds": 448.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "I think that's clear. Thank you for being so thorough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 449.31,
      "end_seconds": 450.02,
      "duration_seconds": 0.71,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}